= The Last Stretch

With three months until Election Day, the question is whether the coalition can turn discontent into turnout, and whether the party can persuade the persuadable. The stakes are as high as they have been in our lifetimes.

- @turnout: All-in on turnout.
- @persuasion: All-in on persuasion.
- @defense: Invest in election protection.

@turnout
subtitle: Base mobilization.
on-arrival: funds -= 2 if funds >= 2; enthusiasm += 6; pop_mod += 0.4

We pour resources into field operations.

@persuasion
subtitle: Moderates and independents.
on-arrival: funds -= 2 if funds >= 2; pop_mod += 0.5; mod_dissent -= 3; media_trust += 1

We invest in persuasion and message testing.

@defense
subtitle: Defend the process.
on-arrival: funds -= 2 if funds >= 2; stability += 5; pop_mod += 0.1

We prepare for disputed results and intimidation.
